_database_PDB_caveat.id     1 
_database_PDB_caveat.text   
;Residues SER B 127 and SER B 132 that are next to each other in the sample sequence are not properly linked: distance between C and N is 13.13.  The distance between Residue H ALA 125 and Residue H SER 132 is 13.57 Angstrom. But there are only 2 residues (not enough sequence) to cover the gap region.
;
